{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1449400-needed-boon-ideas-for-a-daring-purview","id":1449400,"title":"Needed: Boon ideas for a \"Daring\" Purview","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-23T17:46:06-07:00","id":1449400,"title":"Needed: Boon ideas for a \"Daring\" Purview","content":"I'm creating a custom Purview for a character and it's called &quot;Daring&quot;. It's supposed to be about taking chances, overcoming risks, being bold, etc. I plan to use Boon names like the following:<br /> <br /> Do or Do Not<br /> Where Angels Fear to Tread<br /> Whatever You Can Do... (I can do better)<br /> Fools Rush In<br /> What Doesn't Kill You<br /> Daring Do<br /> Fortune Favors the Bold<br /> Throw Caution to the Wind<br /> Hold my Beer!<br /> <br /> I'm looking for some general ideas of the types of abilities/powers that might be appropriate for this purview.<br /> <br /> Some ideas I have are:<br /> Giving allies a bonus to an unskilled check<br /> Get some additional dice for a particularly difficult roll (Must have Difficulty 8+)<br /> Study someone else doing something and then doing the same thing with a bonus<br /> If you do something that qualifies for Daredevil Merit, get a Willpower back<br /> <br /> Any help is appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26857-harliquinn","name":"Harliquinn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T04:00:12-07:00","id":1449446,"title":"","content":"Are you playing first edition by chance? I haven't read first ed in years, but allot of this doesn't make sense with 2nd Ed. If you are doing 2nd, I think this sounds more like a calling than a purview.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24383-laughinggull","name":"LaughingGull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24383_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T08:20:58-07:00","id":1449458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LaughingGull</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1449400-needed-boon-ideas-for-a-daring-purview?p=1449446#post1449446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you playing first edition by chance? I haven't read first ed in years, but allot of this doesn't make sense with 2nd Ed. If you are doing 2nd, I think this sounds more like a calling than a purview.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to say Motif. You take a reckless risk, and that\u2019s the act you work your Marvel through. The character would probably favor Epic Stamina, Epic Dexterity, and Fortune.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T10:01:37-07:00","id":1449469,"title":"","content":"If this is 2ed, I think I would start with the Fortune purview. The 'Nine Lives' boon fits it particularly well. I would then specialize, using the rules in the 'Mysteries of the World' Companion to create a custom boon.<br /> <br /> Some boon ideas:<br /> <br /> 'Raise the stakes: When you take a dangerous action, describe an approach you take that makes it even more dangerous (do it blindfold, set it on fire first etc.). Gain +1 scale and +2 complications to the roll, where the complications include injury to yourself, an ally or causing a fatebinding to become imperilled.'<br /> <br /> 'David v Goliath : When you make a daring attempt against something that has scale over you, gain a +1 enhancement bonus. If you fail, regain a legend.'<br /> <br /> 'Show off : Your daring performances impressive everyone around you. When you show off your daring, you can cause legend+1 targets (or unlimited number of trivial targets) to become enraptured by your performance, granting you a +1 attitude bonus with them and your allies +2 enhancement to avoid detection by them as long as you continue to show off.'<br /> <br /> Drawback: Daring craves an audience. You can only use powers from the Fortune purview in a dramatic and obvious fashion.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26642-notmidas","name":"notMidas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T16:04:30-07:00","id":1449492,"title":"","content":"This is a custom version of the game, but we're using Purviews and Boons <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Thanks NotMidas, those are some really good ideas and I will look into the Fortune Purview for some additional things I can modify!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26857-harliquinn","name":"Harliquinn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}